<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DSC Comms upgraded. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DSC Comms upgraded. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;started&quot; to &quot;upgraded&quot;.)</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analysts Steven Levy and Sender Cohen upgraded DSC Communications Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said had growing confidence in company's ability to grow revenues at more than 20 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- said had end-of-year price target of $35 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 8/16 to 28-7/16.</p>
</text>
